&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Product Design team at AutoScout24 ensures that we create the right products to deliver delight to customers by working closely with cross-functional partners to establish best practices and&amp;nbsp; processes, develop an end-to-end product rollout plan, align cross-functional stakeholders on strategy,&amp;nbsp; track and communicate business metrics, and help scale product knowledge throughout the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
