&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a global IT/OT strategy aligned with business and data center growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital transformation initiatives across data center infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale high-performing global IT/OT teams across multiple regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key advisor to executive leadership on infrastructure, cybersecurity, and operational resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Center &amp;amp; Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee IT systems supporting mission-critical facilities (DCIM, BMS, EMS, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high availability, uptime, and performance of data center infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive standardization of systems, architecture, and processes across global sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams on design, build, and commissioning of new facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT/OT Convergence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration between enterprise IT systems and operational technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish secure, scalable connectivity between data center assets and enterprise platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement best practices for OT cybersecurity, including segmentation and risk mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cybersecurity &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and enforce global IT/OT security frameworks aligned with international standards and industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with data privacy and infrastructure regulations across geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage risk, incident response, and disaster recovery planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement in uptime, efficiency, and cost optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement monitoring, analytics, and reporting tools for real-time visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead vendor selection, partnerships, and contract negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in IT, OT, or infrastructure leadership roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data center experience (hyperscale, colocation, or enterprise environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in IT/OT convergence within critical infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Center Infrastructure Management (DCIM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building Management Systems (BMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network and systems architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling global teams and operations&lt;/li&gt;
